{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"UnslothAI.Unsloth","latestVersion":"0.1.914-beta","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"The first desktop app to run and train AI models locally.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"The first desktop app to run and train AI models locally.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Unsloth Desktop is the first desktop app to run and train AI models locally, with research, export and deployment from the same open-source app on Windows, macOS and Linux. Run and train LLMs and diffusion models including Kimi K3, MiniMax-H3, Gemma 4, Qwen3.8 and DeepSeek-V4 Flash 0731, with self-healing tool calling, sandboxed code execution, private web search, Deep Research, RAG, MCP and an OpenAI-compatible API.","name":"Unsloth","packageUrl":"https://unsloth.ai/download/windows","publisher":"Unsloth AI","publisherUrl":"https://unsloth.ai/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/releases/tag/v0.1.914-beta","tags":["ai","deep-learning","diffusion","fine-tuning","large-language-model","llm","machine-learning"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"第一款在本地运行和训练 AI 模型的桌面应用。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Unsloth Desktop 是第一款在本地运行和训练 AI 模型的桌面应用，可在 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 上完成研究、导出与部署。支持运行和微调 Kimi K3、MiniMax-H3、Gemma 4、Qwen3.8、DeepSeek-V4 Flash 0731 等 LLM 与扩散模型，并提供自愈工具调用、沙盒代码执行、私有网页搜索、Deep Research、RAG、MCP 以及 OpenAI 兼容 API。","tags":["人工智能","大模型","大语言模型","微调","扩散模型","机器学习","深度学习"]}},"longDescription":"Unsloth Desktop is the first desktop app to run and train AI models locally, with research, export and deployment from the same open-source app on Windows, macOS and Linux. Run and train LLMs and diffusion models including Kimi K3, MiniMax-H3, Gemma 4, Qwen3.8 and DeepSeek-V4 Flash 0731, with self-healing tool calling, sandb